[2026-01-30T15:19:16.279Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01R7aovzxCRRdikYC5U5peiS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation complete. Here's a summary:\n\n## Summary: Add Unified Reading Mode Launcher\n\n**Created `src/components/report/features/ReadingModeLauncher.tsx`** - A unified entry point for all reading modes, triggered by keyboard shortcut.\n\n### Key Features:\n\n**Keyboard Shortcuts:**\n- `R` - Opens the launcher modal\n- `F` or `1` - Select Focus/Spotlight mode\n- `S` or `2` - Select Speed reading mode\n- `ESC` - Close launcher or reading mode\n\n**Components:**\n- `ReadingModeLauncher` - Main component that wraps content and provides the launcher\n- `LauncherModal` - Modal with two options (Focus and Speed)\n- `useReadingModeLauncher` - Hook for managing launcher state\n\n**Smart Text Selection:**\n- When user selects text before pressing `R`, that text is used for speed reading\n- Falls back to the provided `text` prop if no selection\n\n**Props:**\n```typescript\ninterface ReadingModeLauncherProps {\n  children: ReactNode;      // Content for spotlight mode\n  text: string;             // Text for speed reading\n  enableShortcut?: boolean; // Enable R key (default: true)\n  wordsPerMinute?: number;  // Speed reading WPM (default: 300)\n  onActivate?: (mode) => void;\n  onClose?: () => void;\n}\n```\n\n**User Journey:**\n1. Select text (optional)\n2. Press `R` to open launcher\n3. Choose mode: Focus (F/1) or Speed (S/2)\n4. Reading mode opens\n5. Press `ESC` to exit\n\n**Theme Support:**\n- Adapts to radar/default themes using `useReportTheme`\n- Consistent styling with existing reading mode components\n\n**Files Changed:**\n- Created: `src/components/report/features/ReadingModeLauncher.tsx`\n- Updated: `src/components/report/features/index.tsx`"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":188,"cache_read_input_tokens":165617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":188},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"5607af41-ea4a-4d62-b55a-f3750555ccf7"}
